{
  "title": "koylu_muhabbet_karaca_usta",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node:start",
      "type": "START",
      "position": "(0.0, 0.0)"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:selam",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(350.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Karaca Usta",
      "text": "Peace be upon you, gatekeeper. The bellows roar and the iron is at heat. There is no room for idle words in an Ahi forge; what is your need?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_normal",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, -180.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "How goes work at the forge, Karaca Usta? How stand the plowshares and shields?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_kriz",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Whispers of brigands grow upon the mountain; do we possess enough weapons and bucklers?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_karar",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, 180.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Have any rumors reached your ears regarding the merchants and travelers at the gate?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_normal",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, -180.0)",
      "character": "Karaca Usta",
      "text": "So long as charcoal lasts, the hammer never falls silent, my son! I ground the dulled axes of the farmers and tempered the spear bodkins for the garrison. Lawful iron never breaks, even if struck against granite."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_kriz",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Karaca Usta",
      "text": "If brigands draw near, we shall forge the village scythes into deadly blades! I bolt seasoned oak planks to the back of every buckler. Ahi warriors will never let their forge be trampled; provided the sentry keeps no slack vigil at the gate!"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_karar",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, 180.0)",
      "character": "Karaca Usta",
      "text": "Let no whisper of illicit silver reach my ears, son! If any man enters by bribery, I will padlock my forge! Yet that Kayseri draper and the smith's apprentice respected the Ahi code; I took the lad as an apprentice, and he works the bellows well."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_normal",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1400.0, -180.0)",
      "description": "Köy Morali",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_kriz",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1400.0, 0.0)",
      "description": "Köy Morali",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_karar",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1400.0, 180.0)",
      "description": "Köy Morali",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node:end",
      "type": "END",
      "position": "(1750.0, 0.0)"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_banu",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, 360.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "We reached an accord with Banu Hatun's fifty horsemen, Karaca Usta; they pitched camp in the grove and stand border watch."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_banu",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, 360.0)",
      "character": "Karaca Usta",
      "text": "If you pay my father's blood debt through this vigil, I shall shoe your mounts and hammer the curve of your blades myself, Banu! With fifty warriors guarding the village perimeter, I will fan the forge day and night, Gatekeeper."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_banu",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1400.0, 360.0)",
      "description": "Village Defense and Morale",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "2"
      ]
    }
  ],
